  m_Name: Note_TideChanges1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Submerged Areas
  key: 6
  topic: 1
  boardContentText: There are some submerged areas that could be accessible
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "\u2026I walk the island in circles. I can't trust my own eyes. The
    water level has dropped. How is that even possible. I hear strange sounds \u2013
    ones that were never here before. And there's a charge in the air, something
    I can't name. This island I've known for so long \u2013 and yet. New places have
    revealed themselves. All this time I walked past them and never saw. As though
    I were blind. When the water recedes, it uncovers a world that was always there
    \u2013 just hidden."
  paperSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cea3c49c6ad23de4286197f5004fc48e, type: 3}
